  "limitations": [
    "Vocabulary is 340 classes (including _BACKGROUND_); MUDRA app words such as NAMASTE, WATER and HELP are not included.",
    "Test clips come from the same signers and recording sessions as training clips (no dataset has signer IDs): 90% of INCLUDE test clips have a same-word training take 1-2 file numbers away, and every team-word test clip a take recorded within 2 minutes. Test accuracy therefore measures new takes by known signers, not new people; on held-out INCLUDE sessions the same recipe reaches about 67%.",
    "Trained on isolated signs; live use cuts the stream into signs with the segmenter in streaming.py and classifies each whole sign once (no continuous sentence recognition).",
    "Temperature and threshold are fitted on the validation split, which shares signers and sessions with training; confidence may be over-confident on new people, cameras or lighting."
